{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wld8wJNAkf1794488604.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國紐約布魯克林區有建築物倒塌，增至最少8人死亡，十多人受傷。</p><p></p><p>事發在當地周三下午約4時，布魯克林區中部一幢三層高建築倒塌，救援人員在瓦礫堆中搜救被困的人。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.COLLAPSE-1000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026G2sFpMJxGh1794488614.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>事發的社區主要是住宅區，居民以黑人及非裔加勒比人為主，倒塌的建築地下是商店，上面是住宅，旁邊的建築正進行拆卸，當局正調查倒塌與工程是否有關。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T14:23:59.030824+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:57:11.407591+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T14:17:20.798258+00:00","content_hash":"83ab9a26c556493cd22bca9cf987770980376ab40f42a42dd8c03bcc1e595108","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T14:23:59.030824+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}